--- Base model ---
  Forecast horizon                                     7 days
  Last training target                                 2023-12-31
  Trees / learning rate / depth                        400 / 0.05 / 6
  min_child_weight / subsample / colsample             5 / 0.9 / 0.9
  Number of features                                   12
  Dispersion of the hurdle                             out of fold, KFold 5
  Quantile grid of the multi-quantile GBM              54 levels, from 0.005 to 0.999

--- Conformal layer ---
  Nominal level                                        1 - alpha = 0.90
  Nonconformity score                                  s = F_x(y) (PIT)
  Calibration window                                   2024-01-01 to 2024-09-01
  Horizon embargo                                      7 days
  Conformal quantile                                   order statistic k = ceil((n+1)(1-alpha_t))

--- Transport ---
  Length of the recent window                          60 days
  Refresh period of the map                            7 days
  Minimum recent scores for a refresh                  100
  Rule for the empirical quantiles                     equispaced grid of g levels on [0,1], g = min(100, max(20, m/2))
  Interpolation scheme                                 piecewise linear, twice
  Bootstrap repetitions of the map                     B = 150
  Tail shrinkage function                              lambda(u) = 1 / (1 + (sd_boot(u)/tau)^2)
  Shrinkage strength                                   tau = 0.05 in PIT units
  Monotonisation                                       running maximum and clip to [0,1]

--- ACI ---
  Update                                               alpha_{t+1} = alpha_t + gamma (alpha - err_t)
  gamma reported in the submitted version              0.02 and 0.05
  gamma selected by rolling origin                     0.005
  Window selected by rolling origin                    120 days
  Bound on alpha_t, submitted version                  [-1, 2]
  Recommended bound on alpha_t                         alpha_min = 0.005
  Order of execution                                   map refresh, then quantile, then interval, then ACI

--- Evaluation ---
  Primary metric                                       one-sided interval score IS = U + (2/alpha) max(y-U, 0)
  Standard error of coverage                           clustered by date
  Bootstrap of the differences between methods         2000 resamples of whole days
  Samples for the CRPS                                 300 per row
  Change-point detection                               PELT and binary segmentation, L2 cost, pen = sigma^2 log n, min_size = 3

